---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { WHATSAPP_BASE_URL } from '../consts';
---

<BaseLayout
	title="How Xpandor Works | The Retail Operating Model"
	description="One client. One expansion team. One accountable partner. Discover the 7-step operational lifecycle behind physical retail expansion."
>
	<!-- Hero Section -->
	<section class="page-hero">
		<div class="container">
			<div class="hero-content">
				<span class="eyebrow">THE OPERATING MODEL</span>
				<h1 class="page-title">One expansion. One team.</h1>
				<p class="page-subhead">
					We replace the friction of coordinating seven disparate vendors with a single accountable expansion partner. Here is how Xpandor manages the journey from brief to trading doors.
				</p>
				<div class="hero-actions">
					<a 
						href={`${WHATSAPP_BASE_URL}?text=Hi%20Preetham,%20I'd%20like%20to%20discuss%20an%20expansion%20plan%20with%20Xpandor.`}
						target="_blank"
						rel="noopener noreferrer"
						class="btn btn-gold"
					>
						<span>Plan Your Expansion on WhatsApp ↗</span>
					</a>
					<a href="#who-owns-what" class="btn btn-outline">
						<span>See Who Owns What</span>
					</a>
				</div>
			</div>
		</div>
	</section>

	<!-- The 7 Steps -->
	<section class="section">
		<div class="container">
			<div class="section-header">
				<span class="eyebrow">The 7-Stage Process</span>
				<h2 class="section-title">The operational lifecycle.</h2>
				<p class="section-desc">
					Each phase builds logically on the preceding one, protecting your capital and ensuring zero communication gaps.
				</p>
			</div>

			<div class="lifecycle-list">
				<div class="life-step">
					<div class="life-num">01</div>
					<div class="life-content">
						<h3 class="life-title">Understand the Expansion</h3>
						<p class="life-desc">
							We formalize your brand's expansion requirements: target customer demographics, unit economics, footfall threshold, ideal square footage, ceiling heights, and regional growth roadmap.
						</p>
					</div>
				</div>

				<div class="life-step">
					<div class="life-num">02</div>
					<div class="life-content">
						<h3 class="life-title">Build the Location Plan</h3>
						<p class="life-desc">
							We survey micro-markets across Bengaluru and South India, analyzing catchment spending power, competitor performance, footfall patterns, and road visibility to build a targeted search grid.
						</p>
					</div>
				</div>

				<div class="life-step">
					<div class="life-num">03</div>
					<div class="life-content">
						<h3 class="life-title">Secure the Property</h3>
						<p class="life-desc">
							We engage property owners directly, evaluate structural & MEP parameters, negotiate commercial lease terms, lock in rent-free fit-out periods, and guide transaction closure.
						</p>
					</div>
				</div>

				<div class="life-step">
					<div class="life-num">04</div>
					<div class="life-content">
						<h3 class="life-title">Plan the Store</h3>
						<p class="life-desc">
							We translate your concept into buildable technical CAD drawings, establish itemized Bill of Quantities (BOQ), finalize material schedules, and secure mall or municipal approvals.
						</p>
					</div>
				</div>

				<div class="life-step">
					<div class="life-num">05</div>
					<div class="life-content">
						<h3 class="life-title">Execute the Project</h3>
						<p class="life-desc">
							Civil, electrical, false ceilings, lighting lines, and custom display joinery are executed under continuous site supervision and tracked against daily milestone programmes.
						</p>
					</div>
				</div>

				<div class="life-step">
					<div class="life-num">06</div>
					<div class="life-content">
						<h3 class="life-title">Prepare the Opening</h3>
						<p class="life-desc">
							Storefront facades and 3D illuminated channel letters are installed. Six weeks before handover, we recruit, screen, and prepare your store manager and retail sales team.
						</p>
					</div>
				</div>

				<div class="life-step highlight-step">
					<div class="life-num text-gold">07</div>
					<div class="life-content">
						<h3 class="life-title text-gold">Hand Over a Trading Store</h3>
						<p class="life-desc">
							Following line-by-line QA/QC and full punch-list resolution, we hand over clean keys to a fully operating, staffed store ready to process customer transactions.
						</p>
					</div>
				</div>
			</div>
		</div>
	</section>

	<!-- Who Owns What Section -->
	<section id="who-owns-what" class="section ownership-section">
		<div class="container">
			<div class="section-header">
				<span class="eyebrow">Accountability Matrix</span>
				<h2 class="section-title">Who owns what?</h2>
				<p class="section-desc">
					We are not a referral marketplace. Here is how accountability is maintained between Xpandor and our specialist trade teams.
				</p>
			</div>

			<div class="ownership-grid">
				<div class="own-card own-xpandor">
					<div class="own-badge">Xpandor Accountability</div>
					<h3 class="own-title">What Xpandor Directly Owns</h3>
					<ul class="own-list">
						<li><strong>Client Relationship & Interface:</strong> One single point of contact for your expansion head and CXOs.</li>
						<li><strong>Commercial Negotiations:</strong> Direct representation for lease structuring, landlord terms, and BOQ audits.</li>
						<li><strong>Master Project Schedule:</strong> Daily progress tracking, procurement critical paths, and opening deadline guarantees.</li>
						<li><strong>Quality Assurance & Inspections:</strong> Line-by-line verification of joinery, finishes, lighting lumens, and snag list clearance.</li>
						<li><strong>Outcome Responsibility:</strong> We own the delivery of a trading store, not individual disconnected service tickets.</li>
					</ul>
				</div>

				<div class="own-card own-trades">
					<div class="own-badge trade-badge">Specialist Execution</div>
					<h3 class="own-title">What Trade Specialists Execute</h3>
					<ul class="own-list">
						<li><strong>Specialized Fabrication:</strong> Precision factory joinery, glass vitrines, and custom metal display islands.</li>
						<li><strong>Licensed Engineering:</strong> Electrical panel load certification, fire NOC compliance, and HVAC balancing.</li>
						<li><strong>Signage Fabrication:</strong> Laser acrylic cutting, channel letter metal bending, and high-spec LED assembly.</li>
						<li><strong>On-Site Craftsmen:</strong> Tiling, ceiling, MEP, and painting teams working under Xpandor site engineers.</li>
					</ul>
				</div>
			</div>
		</div>
	</section>

	<!-- CTA -->
	<section class="section cta-section">
		<div class="container text-center">
			<div class="cta-banner mx-auto">
				<span class="eyebrow">Start Your Rollout</span>
				<h2 class="cta-title">Ready to expand without the chaos?</h2>
				<p class="cta-desc">
					Connect directly with Preetham Phirangi to discuss your brand's store expansion roadmap in Bengaluru and South India.
				</p>
				<a 
					href={`${WHATSAPP_BASE_URL}?text=Hi%20Preetham,%20I'd%20like%20to%20discuss%20how%20Xpandor%20can%20partner%20with%20our%20retail%20expansion.`}
					target="_blank"
					rel="noopener noreferrer"
					class="btn btn-gold btn-large"
				>
					<span>Message Preetham on WhatsApp ↗</span>
				</a>
			</div>
		</div>
	</section>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
	.page-hero {
		padding: 5rem 0 3.5rem;
		border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
		background: radial-gradient(circle at 50% 0%, rgba(212, 175, 55, 0.08) 0%, transparent 70%);
	}

	.hero-content {
		max-width: 820px;
	}

	.page-title {
		font-size: clamp(2.2rem, 5vw, 3.8rem);
		font-weight: 800;
		line-height: 1.15;
		letter-spacing: -0.02em;
		margin: 0.75rem 0 1.25rem;
	}

	.page-subhead {
		font-size: clamp(1.05rem, 2vw, 1.25rem);
		line-height: 1.65;
		color: var(--text-muted);
		margin-bottom: 2.25rem;
	}

	.hero-actions {
		display: flex;
		flex-wrap: wrap;
		gap: 1rem;
	}

	/* Lifecycle List */
	.lifecycle-list {
		display: flex;
		flex-direction: column;
		gap: 1.5rem;
	}

	.life-step {
		background: var(--bg-surface-card);
		border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
		border-radius: var(--radius-sm);
		padding: 2rem 2.5rem;
		display: flex;
		align-items: flex-start;
		gap: 2.5rem;
		transition: all 0.25s ease;
	}

	@media (max-width: 640px) {
		.life-step {
			padding: 1.5rem;
			gap: 1.25rem;
		}
	}

	.life-step:hover {
		border-color: var(--border-gold);
		transform: translateX(4px);
	}

	.highlight-step {
		border-color: var(--border-gold);
		background: rgba(212, 175, 55, 0.04);
	}

	.life-num {
		font-family: var(--font-mono);
		font-size: 2rem;
		font-weight: 800;
		color: var(--accent-gold);
		line-height: 1;
		min-width: 50px;
	}

	.life-title {
		font-size: 1.3rem;
		font-weight: 700;
		margin: 0 0 0.5rem;
	}

	.life-desc {
		font-size: 0.92rem;
		color: var(--text-muted);
		line-height: 1.65;
		margin: 0;
	}

	/* Ownership Section */
	.ownership-section {
		background: #06080E;
		border-top: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
		border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
	}

	.ownership-grid {
		display: grid;
		grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
		gap: 2rem;
	}

	@media (max-width: 860px) {
		.ownership-grid {
			grid-template-columns: 1fr;
		}
	}

	.own-card {
		border-radius: var(--radius-md);
		padding: 2.5rem;
		display: flex;
		flex-direction: column;
	}

	@media (max-width: 640px) {
		.own-card {
			padding: 1.5rem;
		}
	}

	.own-xpandor {
		background: var(--bg-surface-card);
		border: 1px solid var(--border-gold);
		box-shadow: 0 15px 40px -10px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.7);
	}

	.own-trades {
		background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.4);
		border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
	}

	.own-badge {
		font-family: var(--font-mono);
		font-size: 0.72rem;
		text-transform: uppercase;
		letter-spacing: 0.12em;
		padding: 0.3rem 0.75rem;
		border-radius: var(--radius-full);
		width: fit-content;
		background: var(--accent-gold-subtle);
		color: var(--accent-gold);
		border: 1px solid var(--border-gold);
		margin-bottom: 1rem;
	}

	.trade-badge {
		background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.06);
		color: var(--text-muted);
		border-color: var(--border-subtle);
	}

	.own-title {
		font-size: 1.4rem;
		font-weight: 700;
		margin: 0 0 1.5rem;
	}

	.own-list {
		list-style: none;
		padding: 0;
		margin: 0;
		display: flex;
		flex-direction: column;
		gap: 1.25rem;
		font-size: 0.9rem;
	}

	.own-list li {
		color: var(--text-muted);
		line-height: 1.6;
	}

	.own-list strong {
		color: var(--text-main);
		display: block;
		margin-bottom: 0.15rem;
	}

	.cta-banner {
		background: radial-gradient(circle at center, rgba(212, 175, 55, 0.12) 0%, rgba(8, 10, 16, 0) 70%), var(--bg-surface-card);
		border: 1px solid var(--border-gold);
		border-radius: var(--radius-md);
		padding: 4.5rem 2rem;
		text-align: center;
		max-width: 800px;
	}

	.cta-title {
		font-size: clamp(1.8rem, 3.5vw, 2.5rem);
		font-weight: 800;
		margin: 0.75rem 0 1rem;
	}

	.cta-desc {
		font-size: 1.05rem;
		color: var(--text-muted);
		margin-bottom: 2rem;
	}

	.btn-large {
		padding: 0.85rem 2rem;
	}

	.text-center {
		text-align: center;
	}

	.mx-auto {
		margin-left: auto;
		margin-right: auto;
	}
</style>
